{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISMANTLE EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pure satisfaction of taking things apart. From small elements to  entire structures \u2013 every object in the game can be dismantled with realistic physics and deeply satisfying visual and sound effects. Each environment is filled with diverse items waiting to be deconstructed, offering endless variety in your dismantling journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your dismantling capabilities with powerful tools and skills. Unlock advanced equipment that lets you work faster. Invest in upgrades that transform tedious tasks into seamless destruction, making each session more satisfying than the last. The right tools turn you from a novice dismantler into an unstoppable force of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/71691b5afb88f2d0f65493553889c953.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/71691b5afb88f2d0f65493553889c953.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/71691b5afb88f2d0f65493553889c953.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT &amp; EXPAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dismantled object rewards you with valuable resources. Gather them and use them to unlock entirely new environments. Each new map brings fresh challenges and unique objects to take apart. Your collection of resources directly fuels your progression \u2013 the more you dismantle, the more worlds open up before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/80a61accf65d492335722503e53c73ee.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/80a61accf65d492335722503e53c73ee.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/80a61accf65d492335722503e53c73ee.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/2c210ed6822362d48a8f4da0a23b6cac.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/2c210ed6822362d48a8f4da0a23b6cac.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/2c210ed6822362d48a8f4da0a23b6cac.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043010?t=1767697979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/e21e453ce881c87b971d6c8e4a8ec731a703a23f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767697979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/16e2534827494a6cfcdc83bd4209771870db4c11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767697979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/16e2534827494a6cfcdc83bd4209771870db4c11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767697979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISMANTLE EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the pure satisfaction of taking things apart. From small elements to  entire structures \u2013 every object in the game can be dismantled with realistic physics and deeply satisfying visual and sound effects. Each environment is filled with diverse items waiting to be deconstructed, offering endless variety in your dismantling journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/ce7decc752e6861d90028da6f7d461a3.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOUR TOOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your dismantling capabilities with powerful tools and skills. Unlock advanced equipment that lets you work faster. Invest in upgrades that transform tedious tasks into seamless destruction, making each session more satisfying than the last. The right tools turn you from a novice dismantler into an unstoppable force of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.poster.avif?t=1767697979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.webm?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/5b9c0d9f1672fa8ae0021b6c7a73609b.mp4?t=1767697979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043010/extras/71691b5afb88f2d0f65493553889c95